Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:11:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/28] =?UTF-8?q?debian=20=E8=A1=A5=E4=B8=81:=20fix-usb-ad?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d-ugreen-a69c-88de.patch?=
